
Unlike Measures, these calculations are evaluated row-by-row and are stored directly in the `Orders` table. They were created in the Data View to support time-intelligence visuals (Monthly and Weekly trends).

### WeekNum
Used to plot the "Weekly Sales" and "Weekly Profit" line charts.
dax:
WeekNum = WEEKNUM(Orders[Order Date].[Date], 1)

### Month Num
Used for sorting the months chronologically in the visuals (so October doesn't appear before January).
dax:
Month Num = MONTH(Orders[Order Date].[Date])

### Month name
Used for the axis labels in the "Total Sales by Month" charts.
dax:
Month name = FORMAT(Orders[Order Date].[Date], "mmm")

### MonthLabel
A custom label used to isolate specific months (January and December).
dax:
MonthLabel = 
IF( [Month Num] = 1, "Jan", 
    IF( [Month Num] = 12, "Dec", 
        " " 
    )
)

